":"(Fight) ケンカしちゃったときも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":46.8,"end":49.15,"text":"(Down) かなり凹んだときも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":49.15,"end":51.65,"text":"(Shock) ひとりで いたいよなときも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":51.65,"end":54.65,"text":"ふと気づけば 近くにいる しなばもろともー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":57.65,"end":59.65,"text":"なんでだろ そばにいたいんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":59.65,"end":62.38,"text":"キミと一緒なら 時計100倍速！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":62.38,"end":64.32,"text":"楽しいな 楽しすぎるんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":64.32,"end":66.12,"text":"さすが 最強Friend! Hey!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":66.12,"end":67.13,"text":"ななななななな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":67.13,"end":69.28,"text":"なんなのよ やっばいシンクロ感！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":69.28,"end":71.93,"text":"いつも大騒ぎ かなり ご近所迷惑","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":71.93,"end":73.9,"text":"今何時？えっとね ヨロレイヒー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":73.9,"end":75.33,"text":"わけわかんないない！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":75.33,"end":77.94,"text":"ソーレードーシーラー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":77.94,"end":80.48,"text":"想像以上！なんていうか最高！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":80.48,"end":81.58,"text":"あーだーこーだー言ってても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":81.58,"end":82.85,"text":"友達 わっしょい！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":82.85,"end":83.99,"text":"上々 友情！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":83.99,"end":86.53,"text":"万事 まじ 快調！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":86.53,"end":87.67,"text":"ななななななな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":87.67,"end":90.67,"text":"なななななななな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":93.96000000000001,"end":96.05,"text":"（ヒャダインのじょーじょーゆーじょー","translati